an ink cartridge replacement#Procedure#{1}":[64,65],"#Maintenance plan examples#Define a maintenance schedule for an ink cartridge replacement#Procedure#{2}":[66,70],"#Maintenance plan examples#Define a maintenance schedule for an ink cartridge replacement#Procedure#{3}":[71,72],"#Maintenance plan examples#Define a maintenance schedule for an ink cartridge replacement#Procedure#{4}":[73,80],"#Maintenance plan examples#Define a maintenance schedule for an ink cartridge replacement#Result":[81,84],"#Maintenance plan examples#Define a maintenance schedule for an ink cartridge replacement#Result#{1}":[83,84],"#Maintenance plan examples#Define a maintenance schedule to run antivirus software":[85,112],"#Maintenance plan examples#Define a maintenance schedule to run antivirus software#{1}":[87,88],"#Maintenance plan examples#Define a maintenance schedule to run antivirus software#Procedure":[89,108],"#Maintenance plan examples#Define a maintenance schedule to run antivirus software#Procedure#{1}":[91,92],"#Maintenance plan examples#Define a maintenance schedule to run antivirus software#Procedure#{2}":[93,96],"#Maintenance plan examples#Define a maintenance schedule to run antivirus software#Procedure#{3}":[97,98],"#Maintenance plan examples#Define a maintenance schedule to run antivirus software#Procedure#{4}":[99,100],"#Maintenance plan examples#Define a maintenance schedule to run antivirus software#Procedure#{5}":[101,108],"#Maintenance plan examples#Define a maintenance schedule to run antivirus software#Result":[109,112],"#Maintenance plan examples#Define a maintenance schedule to run antivirus software#Result#{1}":[111,112],"#Maintenance plan examples#Related":[113,117],"#Maintenance plan examples#Related#{1}":[115,115],"#Maintenance plan examples#Related#{2}":[116,117]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Planned Maintenance","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/service-management-for-the-enterprise/planned-maintenance-family/c_SMPlanMaint.md","line":30},{"title":"Planned Maintenance","target":"c_SMPlanMaint","line":38},{"title":"create a maintenance plan","target":"t_CreateAMaintPlan","line":40},{"title":"Planned Maintenance","target":"c_SMPlanMaint","line":115},{"title":"Create a maintenance plan","target":"t_CreateAMaintPlan","line":116}],"metadata":{"title":"Maintenance plan examples","description":"You can define maintenance plans using model-based, meter-based, or duration-based selection criteria.To schedule a reboot for certain computer models after a specified number of keystrokes, define a model-based plan with a meter-based maintenance schedule. In the example, a field called keystrokes is added to the Computer \\[cmdb\\_ci\\_computer\\] table.To schedule a printer ink cartridge replacement after printing a specified number of pages, define a general plan with a meter-based maintenance schedule. In the example, a table called Printer is added with string fields for printer, model, pages, and the like.To schedule an antivirus scan on certain computers after a specified number of days, define a model-based plan with a duration-based maintenance schedule. In the example, a field called trigger type is added to the Computer \\[cmdb\\_ci\\_computer\\] table.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/service-management-for-the-enterprise/planned-maintenance-family/r\\_MaintPlanExamples.html","release":"australia","product":"Planned Maintenance \\(Family\\)","classification":"planned-maintenance-family","topic_type":"reference","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":3,"breadcrumb":["Planned Maintenance","Service Management"],"tags":["#service-management-for-the-enterprise","#planned-maintenance","#scheduling","#downtime","#sme","#type-reference"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:ServiceNowOfficialDocs/service-management-for-the-enterprise/planned-maintenance-family/r_MaintPlanExamples.md#---frontmatter---": {"path